{"id":115168,"vol":{"id":19220,"name":"Tales of the Sinestro Corps: Cyborg-Superman"},"num":"1","name":"Death of a Cyborg","title":"Tales of the Sinestro Corps: Cyborg-Superman #1","year":"2007","date":"2007-12-01","store":"2007-10-03","poster":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_medium/0/40/203692-19220-115168-1-tales-of-the-sinestr.jpg","big":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_large/0/40/203692-19220-115168-1-tales-of-the-sinestr.jpg","pub":"DC Comics","deck":"","desc":"Overview\n\nWho is Hank Henshaw? What made him the Cyborg Superman, and what does he hope the Sinestro Corp can give him? Alan Burnett (SUPERMAN/BATMAN, Batman: The Animated Series) peels away the mysterious layers of the mechanical monster as the new JLA Watchtower's defenses are put to the test against him and the Sinestro Corps!\n\nTo be continued in Green Lantern #24","people":[{"id":42763,"name":"Adam Schlagman","role":"editor"},{"id":45108,"name":"Alan Burnett","role":"writer"},{"id":44298,"name":"David Curiel","role":"colorist"},{"id":41680,"name":"Eddie Berganza","role":"editor"},{"id":9317,"name":"Ethan Van Sciver","role":"artist, cover"},{"id":8662,"name":"Jay Leisten","role":"inker"},{"id":17708,"name":"Moose Baumann","role":"colorist, cover"},{"id":47643,"name":"Patrick Blaine","role":"penciler"},{"id":47630,"name":"Steve Wands","role":"letterer"}],"chars":[{"id":1807,"name":"Superman","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/11174/111743204/9725017-actioncomics%231081davidtalaski.jpg"},{"id":10448,"name":"Sinestro","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/11114/111147698/7005037-sinestro-yotv-1.jpg"},{"id":12926,"name":"Cyborg Superman","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/11111/111113340/9032618-return-of-superman-30th-anniversary-special-1-cyborg-superman.jpg"}],"arcs":[{"id":50650,"name":"\"Green Lantern\" Sinestro Corps War"}]}